### 1. No token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me

### 2. Garbage token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer this.is.not.a.token

### 3. Sign in as admin (REST Client remembers the cookie)
# @name signin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "admin@wedplan.com",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

### 4. Get a JWT from Better Auth
# @name tokenReq
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/token
Origin: http://localhost:3000

### 5. Admin token on /api/me (expect 200, role admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenReq.response.body.token}}

### 6. Admin on admin-only route (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenReq.response.body.token}}

### 7. Admin on vendor-only route (expect 403)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/me/vendor-only
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenReq.response.body.token}}